# FAG hub — "Pick your team." lead-in (asset-specific)

**Scope: Field Activation Guide hub only.** This is not a house-wide section-subheader pattern.

## What it is

On the FAG hub picker, under the heading "Start using LUCI differently by Monday.", the line **"Pick your team."** is a **lead-in sentence** that invites the reader to choose a team card. It is not an H3 / section subhead.

Reference: `ui_kits/sales/field-activation-guide-hub.html` — `.fag-pick__subhead`

Treatment (local to this asset):
- `font-family: var(--font-body)` (Inter)
- `font-size: clamp(16px, 1.3vw, 18px)`
- `line-height: 1.5`
- `color: var(--accent-light)` on light

## What it is not

- Not a default for section subheads / H3s on sales documents, the website, decks, or any other asset
- Not a replacement for kickers site-wide
- Not a pattern to copy when Jane asks for "standard" subheaders elsewhere

If another asset needs a similar lead-in sentence, ask Jane first — do not pull this treatment across by default.
